CONTRACT CLARIFICATION

architect_returns_plan_graph_only: true
architect_returns_resultproposal: false
executor_returns_resultproposal_only: true
active_executor_emits_schema_valid_resultproposal: true
fractal_dag_returns_resultproposal_shaped_boundary_artifacts: true
resultproposal_shaped_is_finaloutput: false
resultproposal_shaped_is_authority: false
resultproposal_shaped_authorizes_action: false
resultproposal_shaped_writes_drs: false
child_boundary_snapshots_are_root_final: false
post_vv_gt_root_required_after_resultproposal_boundary: true
root_remains_final_authority: true

Clarified contract:

- Architect returns PlanGraph only.
- Architect does not return ResultProposal.
- Architect does not execute plan nodes.
- Architect does not create FinalOutput.
- Architect does not write DRS.
- Executor receives validated PlanGraph node(s).
- Executor returns ResultProposal only.
- Active Executor output is schema-valid ResultProposal.
- Fractal DAG consumes valid PlanGraph / DAG node structure.
- Fractal DAG may return ResultProposal-shaped boundary artifacts.
- Atomic node outputs and child boundary snapshots are not Root Final.
- Child cell / node outputs remain internal or boundary artifacts until wrapped
  into the parent ResultProposal path.
- All branch outputs still flow through Post V&V / GT / Root.


